msgid "VirusTotal Checker"
msgstr "VirusTotal Tekshiruvchi"

msgid "VirusTotal"
msgstr "VirusTotal"

msgid "Checks the focused file with VirusTotal. Press twice for a detailed report."
msgstr "Tanlangan faylni VirusTotal orqali tekshiradi. To'liq hisobot uchun 2 marta bosing."

msgid "VirusTotal &API Key:"
msgstr "VirusTotal &API Kaliti:"

msgid "Play audio &beep during file upload"
msgstr "Fayl yuklanayotganda audio &bip chalinsin"

msgid "Automatically &copy results to clipboard"
msgstr "Natijalar avtomatik xotiraga &nusxalansin"

msgid "Automatically &upload file if hash not found"
msgstr "Xesh topilmasa fayl avtomatik &yuklansin"

msgid "Please set your VirusTotal API key in NVDA settings."
msgstr "Iltimos, NVDA sozlamalaridan VirusTotal API kalitini kiriting."

msgid "No file focused in Windows Explorer."
msgstr "Windows Explorer'da hech qanday fayl tanlanmagan."

msgid "Checking VirusTotal..."
msgstr "VirusTotal tekshirilmoqda..."

msgid "Could not read file for hashing."
msgstr "Xeshni hisoblash uchun faylni o'qib bo'lmadi."

msgid "Hash not found. Uploading file..."
msgstr "Xesh topilmadi. Fayl yuklanmoqda..."

msgid "File uploaded and queued for analysis. Try checking again later."
msgstr "Fayl yuklandi va navbatga qo'yildi. Birozdan so'ng qayta tekshiring."

msgid "File not found in VirusTotal database."
msgstr "Fayl VirusTotal bazasidan topilmadi."

msgid "VirusTotal Detailed Report"
msgstr "VirusTotal To'liq Hisoboti"

msgid "Result copied to clipboard."
msgstr "Natija xotiraga nusxalandi."

msgid "Network or API error occurred."
msgstr "Tarmoqda yoki APIda xatolik yuz berdi."

msgid "Get API &Key from website"
msgstr "Saytdan API &kalit olish"

msgid "Analysis complete: "
msgstr "Tahlil yakunlandi: "

msgid "Analysis is taking too long. Please press the shortcut later."
msgstr "Tahlil juda uzoq davom etyapti. Iltimos birozdan so'ng klavishni o'zingiz bosing."

msgid "No results."
msgstr "Natija topilmadi."

msgid "Detection ratio: {count}/{total}"
msgstr "Aniqlanish darajasi: {count}/{total}"

msgid "No detailed results available."
msgstr "Batafsil natijalar mavjud emas."

msgid "No engines detected this file as malicious."
msgstr "Hech qaysi antivirus bu faylni zararli deb topmadi."

msgid "Checks the focused file with VirusTotal using its SHA-256 hash or by uploading it, and allows checking URLs/Hashes manually.  How to get an API Key: 1. Register a free account at virustotal.com. 2. Go to your Profile -> API Key and copy your key. 3. Open NVDA Settings -> VirusTotal and paste the key.  How to set Hotkeys (None by default): 1. Go to NVDA Menu -> Preferences -> Input Gestures. 2. Expand the 'VirusTotal' category. 3. Assign your preferred shortcuts for checking a file and opening the manual check dialog. Features Multi-language support (English, Russian, Uzbek)."
msgstr "Tanlangan faylni SHA-256 xeshi yoki faylning o'zini yuklash orqali VirusTotal'da tekshiradi, hamda URL va Xeshlarni qo'lda kiritib tekshirish imkonini beradi.  API Kalitini qanday olish mumkin: 1. virustotal.com saytidan ro'yxatdan o'ting. 2. Profilingiz -> API Key bo'limidan kalitni oling. 3. NVDA Sozlamalari -> VirusTotal bo'limiga kalitni joylashtiring.  Tezkor klavishlarni belgilash (standart belgilanmagan): 1. NVDA Menyusi -> Parametrlar -> Kiritish imo-ishoralari. 2. 'VirusTotal' toifasini kengaytiring. 3. Fayl tekshirish va qo'lda kiritish oynasiga klavishlarni biriktiring. Ko'p tillarni qo'llab-quvvatlaydi (Ingliz, Rus, O'zbek)."

msgid "Check API Limits"
msgstr "API Limitlarini Tekshirish"

msgid "Please enter your API Key first."
msgstr "Iltimos avval API kalitni kiriting."

msgid "VirusTotal API Limits:\n\n"
msgstr "VirusTotal API Limitlari:\n\n"

msgid "Minute Limit: 4 requests / minute (Standard Free Limit)\n"
msgstr "Daqiqalik Limit: 4 so'rov / daqiqa (Standart bepul limit)\n"

msgid "Hourly Usage: {used} / {allowed}\n"
msgstr "Soatlik foydalanish: {used} / {allowed}\n"

msgid "Daily Usage: {used} / {allowed}\n"
msgstr "Kunlik foydalanish: {used} / {allowed}\n"

msgid "API Limits"
msgstr "API Limitlar"

msgid "Failed to retrieve limits. Check your API key and connection."
msgstr "Limitlarni olishda xatolik. Kalitni va tarmoqni tekshiring."

msgid "Error"
msgstr "Xato"
